				"BrandEnabled" => ("Keep original HP loss before card selection. Hover left to right to aim high to low; after selection, the hand plays independently. Zero or one remaining card needs no selection pause.", "按原版时机在选牌前扣血。悬停的牌从左到右对应手臂从上到下；选牌后手臂独立播放，零张或一张手牌无需等待选择。", "按原版時機在選牌前扣血。懸停的牌從左到右對應手臂從上到下；選牌後手臂獨立播放，零張或一張手牌無需等待選擇。"), 
				"BattleTranceEnabled" => ("Play the demon hand ringing a bell behind the character. Card effects proceed independently; the hand fades during the third swing.", "人物后方的恶魔手独立摇铃，第三次摇动时淡出；抽牌和卡牌结算无需等待动画。", "人物後方的惡魔手獨立搖鈴，第三次搖動時淡出；抽牌和卡牌結算無需等待動畫。"), 
				"CardWeaponsEnabled" => ("Bash and Break use a mace; Bludgeon uses a hammer. Follows original actions without changing card timing. Incompatible character skins keep their own weapons.", "痛击（Bash）、破击（Break）使用狼牙棒，重锤（Bludgeon）使用重锤。跟随原版动作，不改变出牌时机；不兼容的人物皮肤保留自己的武器。", "痛擊（Bash）、破擊（Break）使用狼牙棒，重錘（Bludgeon）使用重錘。跟隨原版動作，不改變出牌時機；不相容的人物皮膚保留自己的武器。"), 
				"FeedEnabled" => ("Play the Feed demon bite, timed to the target taking damage. Original damage and maximum HP rewards are unchanged.", "打出时播放恶魔撕咬，与目标受伤同步。保留原本的伤害与生命上限奖励。", "打出時播放惡魔撕咬，與目標受傷同步。保留原本的傷害與生命上限獎勵。"), 
				"DemonFormEnabled" => ("Play the demon howl when Demon Form is played. Original card effects are unchanged.", "打出时播放恶魔长啸。保留原本的卡牌效果。", "打出時播放惡魔長嘯。保留原本的卡牌效果。"), 
				"ShrugItOffEnabled" => ("Play the shrug animation when Shrug It Off is played. Original Block and card draw are unchanged.", "打出时播放摊手耸肩动作。保留原本的格挡与抽牌效果。", "打出時播放攤手聳肩動作。保留原本的格擋與抽牌效果。"), 
				"DarkEmbraceEnabled" => ("Play seven spectral hands and local shadows independently. Hands follow the character; later actions do not interrupt the effect or wait for it.", "七只鬼手与局部暗区独立播放，抓握跟随人物；后续动作不打断演出，也无需等待动画。", "七隻鬼手與局部暗區獨立播放，抓握跟隨人物；後續動作不打斷演出，也無需等待動畫。"), 
				_ => throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException("key", key, "Unknown animation setting"), 
			};
			bool flag;
			switch (key)
			{
			case "DarkEmbraceEnabled":
			case "BattleTranceEnabled":
			case "DemonFormEnabled":
			case "CardWeaponsEnabled":
				flag = true;
				break;
			default:
				flag = false;
				break;
			}
			if (flag)
			{
				text += " In multiplayer, also shows teammates' Ironclads on your screen.";
				text2 += " 多人时也显示队友铁甲的效果。";
				text3 += " 多人時也顯示隊友鐵甲的效果。";
			}
			else if (key == "BarricadeEnabled")
			{
				text += " Multiplayer shows only your own wall; character placement is single-player only.";
				text2 += " 多人仅显示自己的盾墙；人物放盾动作仅限单人。";
				text3 += " 多人僅顯示自己的盾牆；人物放盾動作僅限單人。";
			}
			else
			{
				text += " Single-player only.";
				text2 += " 仅限单人模式。";
				text3 += " 僅限單人模式。";
			}
			if (!english && Chinese)
			{
				if (!Traditional)
				{
					return text2;
				}
				return text3;
			}
			return text;
		}
	}
